    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d619-a2">

                <pb facs="0758" n="670" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg670"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The prime minister to the
                            minister for foreign affairs.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mubarekabad</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-07-20"><hi rendition="#italic">July 20,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Your Excellency</hi>: His Majesty has personally
                    stated that orders have been dispatched to the Crown Prince and the governor of
                    Urumia, so that if Mir Ghaffar had any accomplices they are to be arrested.</p>
                <p>You are also well aware that I have sent the most imperative orders; but the
                    names of accomplices, with proofs that they are the men implicated, are
                    required, in order that they may be arrested.</p>
                <p>Yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Eyn-ed-Dowlah</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Prime Minister.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
